<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5630" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμῠχ-ή</span></b> , ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμύσσω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>scratch, skin-wound,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Epid.</u>
				7.32
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμυχὰς καταμύξαντες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phryn.Com.
					3
				</span></i>
			; of <i>marks of strangling,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
				47.59
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> Medic.,
				<i>scarification,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Antyll.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				7.18.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				10.964
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄμυξις</span>
			, in sign of sorrow, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμυχὰς κοπτομένων ἀφεῖλεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Sol.</u>
					21
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. καὶ ἑλκώσεις ἐν ταῖς φιλίαις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Iamb.
					<u>VP</u>
					33.231
				</span></i>
			.</div>
